      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ところで、レイン。\r\n私を呼ぶとき、「博士」はつけなくていいって\r\nいつも言ってるでしょ？",
        "official_en": "And by the way, Rain, for the umpteenth time, you really don’t need to address me as “Professor.”",
        "real_en": "And Rain, I keep telling you: you don't have to call me 'Professor.'"
      },
