      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "恥ずかしがることないじゃない。\r\nあなたが騎士団に入るための\r\n座学をつけてあげたのも私なのよ？",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">Embarrassing</>? I don’t need to remind you who tutored you when you were studying to become a knight, do I?",
        "real_en": "There's no need to be <text style=\"italic\">embarrassed</>. I was the one who tutored you when you were studying to become a knight, remember?"
